DATA ACCESS NOTE:

The raw artwork images and applicant metadata used in this study are NOT
included in this repository due to (1) copyright on source materials hosted
at midaeipsi.com and (2) personal information protection requirements
applicable to applicant records. Aggregated/anonymized analysis state files
under `outputs/shared_state/` are released for verification purposes only.

Researchers interested in obtaining access to the underlying data should
contact the author directly.
